    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The object: 을 / 를",
     "texto": [
      "What you eat, see or buy takes the object particle: **을** after a consonant and **를** after a vowel.",
      "밥**을** 먹어요 (I eat rice). 커피**를** 마셔요 (I drink coffee). 친구**를** 만나요 (I meet up with a friend).",
      "To say where you are going, **에** is used: 학교**에** 가요 (I am going to school)."
     ],
